    "cuda": "Prepared/shared Queue, caller device workspace2*M*K bytes, no provider-private invocation/result allocation or host wait. A quantized once; original packed W read in bounded rows/groups. RequireCapture executed.",
    "row_reuse": "Moved existing MLX/CT packed_rows body to shared private header, only Scalar template deduction and namespace qualification changed. Existing MLX and CT codecs, rounding and launch geometries preserved;26 related CUDA cases executed.",
    "resource_fix": "Explicit workspace device requirement on CUDA; both backends reject workspace aliasing inputs/outputs. CPU Direct tests A/W alias with sufficiently large/aligned physical backing and verifies every input byte unchanged, followed by normal output20.625."
